  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0\n            \n            - [Feature] Support inherited members\n            \n            1.2.2\n\n            - [Bugfix] Skip already implemented explicit members\n\n            1.2.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Correct version metadata\n\n            1.2.0\n\n            - [Feature] Support Ref Parameters\n\n            1.1.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Handle New Members in Adopted Interfaces\n\n            1.1.0\n\n            - Added index property delegation\n\n            1.0.2\n\n            - More documentation improvements\n\n            1.0.1\n\n            - Improved documentation\n\n            1.0.0\n\n            - Added project documentation and licensing.\n\n            0.2.0\n\n            - Support attaching [Adopt] to properties.\n            - Support events.\n            - Support nested interfaces.\n\n            0.1.0\n\n            - Initial version supporting attaching [Adopt] to members.",
